---
// src/components/HowItWorksSection.astro
---

<section id="cara-kerja" class="py-16 bg-devr-bg border-b border-devr-border transition-colors relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14 space-y-3">
      <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-devr-card border border-devr-border text-devr-green font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
        PROSES TRANSPARAN &amp; TANPA RIBET
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-devr-text-primary tracking-tight">
        3 LANGKAH MUDAH MEMILIKI <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        <span class="text-devr-green">WEBSITE IMPIAN ANDA</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-devr-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
        Kami menghilangkan seluruh kerumitan teknis. Anda cukup bercerita tentang bisnis Anda, dan kami wujudkan menjadi landing page berdaya jual tinggi.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Steps Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 relative">
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="relative rounded-2xl bg-devr-card border border-devr-border p-7 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-devr-green/60 transition-all duration-300 group shadow-xl">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-4xl font-black text-devr-green font-mono">01</span>
            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-devr-green/10 border border-devr-green/30 flex items-center justify-center text-devr-green group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 01-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z" />
              </svg>
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-devr-text-primary group-hover:text-devr-green transition-colors">
            Konsultasi &amp; Minta Desain Awal
          </h3>

          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-devr-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Diskusikan tujuan bisnis dan produk unggulan Anda via WhatsApp. Kami langsung siapkan rancangan konsep visual awal (UI preview) sebelum ada ikatan kontrak.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-devr-border/60 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-devr-text-muted">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-devr-green"></span>
          100% Bebas Risiko &amp; Tanpa Biaya di Awal
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="relative rounded-2xl bg-devr-card border border-devr-border p-7 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-devr-green/60 transition-all duration-300 group shadow-xl">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-4xl font-black text-devr-green font-mono">02</span>
            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-devr-green/10 border border-devr-green/30 flex items-center justify-center text-devr-green group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4" />
              </svg>
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-devr-text-primary group-hover:text-devr-green transition-colors">
            Development &amp; Revisi Fleksibel
          </h3>

          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-devr-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Cocok dengan konsepnya? Kami mulai membangun landing page fungsional berkecepatan tinggi. Anda bebas mengajukan revisi hingga tata letak dan pesan promosi pas.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-devr-border/60 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-devr-text-muted">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-devr-green"></span>
          Revisi Garansi Pasti Sampai Cocok
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="relative rounded-2xl bg-devr-card border border-devr-border p-7 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-devr-green/60 transition-all duration-300 group shadow-xl">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-4xl font-black text-devr-green font-mono">03</span>
            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-devr-green/10 border border-devr-green/30 flex items-center justify-center text-devr-green group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
              </svg>
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-devr-text-primary group-hover:text-devr-green transition-colors">
            Website Live &amp; Siap Terima Order
          </h3>

          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-devr-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Website resmi mengudara di domain Anda, terhubung langsung ke tombol WhatsApp, loading kilat, dan Anda bisa mengganti foto atau teks dengan sangat mudah kapan pun.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-devr-border/60 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-devr-text-muted">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-devr-green"></span>
          Hosting Super Cepat Aktif Selamanya
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA strip under steps -->
    <div class="mt-12 text-center">
      <a
        href="https://wa.me/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-devr-green-text bg-devr-green hover:bg-devr-green-hover rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 transform hover:scale-105 shadow-lg shadow-devr-green/20"
      >
        <span>Mulai Konsultasi &amp; Request Desain Awal Sekarang</span>
        <span>&rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
